5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be logical about the budget and the risks of cancellations. I'll start by looking into the costs and terms.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I'm more interested in the actual quality of the stay. If we don't sleep, we don't train. I'll check the inland reports.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to make sure the people organizing it don't have to work too hard. I'll look into the cooking and bookings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree we need financial clarity. I'll check the transport receipts and the public rate sheets to see where the money goes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We need to actually bond this time. I'm looking into how the year-groups mix and who actually shows up to these things.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
