55,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option C is the most expensive and riskiest regarding cancellations. Option B is safest for the budget but lacks cohesion.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A is out due to the sleeping conditions. Option B is problematic because of the commute and hall availability.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A is too much work for the organizers. Option C sounds much more relaxing for everyone involved.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A is cheap per bed, but the transport is the variable. Option B is the only one that guarantees no budget deficit.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option C is the only one that ensures we all sleep in the same place and actually bond. It's worth the risk.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, the ""risk"" is that the remaining members pay for those who drop out. That's unfair to the students.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, if we do Option B, we still have to pay for beds for a third of the members. It's not as cheap as it looks.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Asuka, but if we go to the lodge, we don't have to worry about the lottery or the cooking duty.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still worried about the total cost. However, Option A's lottery system makes it too unreliable to plan a budget around.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"If we stay on campus, we're just doing what we always do. We need a change of scenery to bring the year-groups together.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we choose C, we must be very strict about the headcount. But logically, it solves the cooking and booking stress.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I can't support A. Between B and C, C provides better recovery and sleep, which is my priority for the training.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minato,,I vote for C. It seems the most peaceful and the least burdensome for the people organizing it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm hesitant, but if B is actually expensive due to the commute and A is a lottery, C is a known cost.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm all for C. It's the only way to make sure the club doesn't keep falling apart.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will prioritize the training quality and the organizers' sanity this time. I'll go with C, provided we manage the list.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. C is the only option that doesn't compromise sleep or logistics.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'm happy with C.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'll agree to C, but I'll be watching the accounts very closely.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Takumi,,Perfect. Let's make this camp one that actually brings us together.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
